   - mockGenerateMetadata

3. Simplified the ImportedComponent to use a direct mock implementation:
   - Using Promise.resolve instead of dynamic import
   - Providing a simple mock structure that matches the expected component

4. Created a mockModules object to keep track of all mocked dependencies

5. Kept all the provider setup and configuration the same

These changes should resolve the "jest is not defined" error while still maintaining the same functionality. The component should now render properly with all the necessary mocks and providers in place.

